,(35,1,6,17,5,1,'online','submitted',NULL,'2026-10-16 13:31:00','2026-10-20 23:49:16',NULL,'2026-10-16 13:49:00',0,2.00,2.00,7.00,'graded',NULL,NULL,'draft',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-16 13:49:00','GCJCRN3BK4','2026-10-16 13:31:00','2026-10-16 13:49:00'),(36,1,9,6,8,1,'online','submitted','I infer that Mara is worried about being late for something important. She has been waiting at the stop \"for the third time that week\", and she keeps \"glancing at her wristwatch and tapping her foot\". People do that when time is running out. She still lets the older women board first, so she is considerate even when she is in a hurry.','2026-10-15 10:22:00',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-15 11:12:00',0,NULL,9.00,10.00,'graded','Strong inference. Add one more sentence explaining how the second clue supports your idea.','{\"c1\":4,\"c2\":3,\"c3\":2}','released','2026-10-16 23:24:16',4,'2026-10-16 23:24:16','DFBZF23DKE','2026-10-15 10:22:00','2026-10-20 23:24:16'),(37,1,9,7,8,1,'online','submitted','Mara is worried about being late because she keeps looking at her watch and tapping her foot. She has waited many times this week.','2026-10-14 11:25:00',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-14 12:15:00',0,NULL,8.00,10.00,'graded','Good work. You found the right clues; push your inference a step further than the text states.','{\"c1\":3,\"c2\":3,\"c3\":2}','released','2026-10-16 23:24:16',4,'2026-10-16 23:24:16','RQUSPDCPC4','2026-10-14 11:25:00','2026-10-20 23:24:16'),(38,1,9,8,8,1,'online','submitted','Mara is anxious about time, probably about being late for school or work. The clues are that she checks her watch again and again and taps her foot, and that this is the third time this week she has waited. Her umbrella on a clear day might show she is always prepared, or that the weather has been unpredictable.','2026-10-15 12:28:00',NULL,NULL,'2026-10-15 13:18:00',0,NULL,10.00,10.00,'graded','Excellent. Your inference is well supported, and you explained how each clue connects to it.','{\"c1\":4,\"c2\":4,\"c3\":2}','rel